<?php if($page==='author-instruction'): ?><p>The process for preparing a manuscript for submission to the journal is outlined as follows:</p><h2>Page Format</h2><ul><li>Submit in English as a Microsoft Word file.</li><li>Use Times New Roman 10, A4 size, within 30 printable pages.</li><li>Maintain 1-inch margins, single-column layout and single spacing throughout.</li></ul><h2>Manuscript Structure</h2><ol><li>Concise descriptive title.</li><li>Full author names, affiliations and corresponding-author email.</li><li>Single-paragraph abstract of no more than 300 words.</li><li>Up to 7 keywords.</li><li>Introduction.</li><li>Detailed Materials and Methods.</li><li>Results and Discussion.</li><li>Conclusion.</li><li>Optional acknowledgment, grants and funding.</li><li>APA references, cited as (Anju B, 2018) or (Anju B et al., 2018).</li></ol><p>Provide full names, affiliations, email addresses and phone numbers for authors.</p>
<?php elseif($page==='open-access-policy'): ?><p>ISAR Publisher's open access policy promotes unrestricted access to research and maximizes its impact. Published articles are freely available worldwide without subscription barriers.</p><p>Articles use the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC-BY-NC), permitting access and distribution with proper attribution.</p><p>This policy democratizes knowledge and fosters collaborative, inclusive research.</p>
<?php elseif($page==='ReviewGuidlines'): ?><p>Reviewers provide impartial evaluation and help journals make informed publication decisions.</p><ol><li>Assess relevance to journal scope.</li><li>Check novelty and originality.</li><li>Evaluate citations and prior work.</li><li>Examine methodology.</li><li>Verify conclusions against results.</li><li>Assess statistical analyses.</li><li>Ensure clarity.</li><li>Check language and presentation.</li><li>Verify technical accuracy, figures and references.</li></ol><h2>Reviewing Process</h2><p>ISAR follows double-blind peer review. Recommendations are major or minor revision, rejection where scientific validity is lacking, or acceptance where results support a meaningful contribution.</p>
<?php elseif($page==='EditorGuidlines'): ?><p>Editorial board members are subject experts who review manuscripts, advise on policy and scope, propose special issues, attract authors, promote the journal and identify peer reviewers.</p><ol><li>Evaluate work fairly and constructively.</li><li>Protect confidential material.</li><li>Disclose conflicts of interest.</li><li>Uphold publication ethics.</li><li>Make timely decisions based on scholarly quality.</li></ol>
<?php elseif($page==='PublicationFee'||$page==='processingFees'): ?><h2>Fast Track Publication Fee</h2><p>For any journal, an accepted article may be published within 2 days.</p><ul><li><b>India:</b> Rs. 6000 INR</li><li><b>Foreign:</b> USD 150$</li></ul><p>This is additional to standard fees.</p><h2>Normal Process</h2><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-bordered"><thead><tr><th>Journal Name</th><th>Indian (INR)</th><th>Foreign (USD)</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $__currentLoopData = [['ISAR Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences','4000','100$'],['ISAR Journal of Multidisciplinary Research and Studies','4000','100$'],['ISAR Journal of Medical and Pharmaceutical Sciences','4000','100$'],['ISAR Journal of Economics and Business Management','4000','100$'],['ISAR Journal of Science and Technology','3000','75$'],['ISAR Journal of Agriculture and Biology','3000','75$']]; $__env->addLoop($__currentLoopData); foreach($__currentLoopData as $f): $__env->incrementLoopIndices(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?><tr><td><?php echo e($f[0]); ?></td><td><?php echo e($f[1]); ?></td><td><?php echo e($f[2]); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; $__env->popLoop(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?></tbody></table></div>
