<?php elseif($page==='GenerativeAIPolicy'): ?><p>Generative AI cannot be listed as an author. Authors remain responsible for accuracy, originality and attribution and must disclose material AI assistance.</p><p>AI may improve readability but cannot replace researcher judgment. Reviewers and editors must not upload confidential manuscripts to public AI systems.</p>
<?php elseif($page==='EthicsPolicies'): ?><p>ISAR Publisher maintains high publication-ethics standards and follows COPE guidance.</p><h2>Authors</h2><ul><li>Submit original, accurate and properly attributed work.</li><li>Do not submit simultaneously to multiple journals.</li><li>List only significant contributors and disclose conflicts.</li></ul><h2>Reviewers</h2><ul><li>Maintain confidentiality and objectivity.</li><li>Decline conflicts and review on time.</li></ul><h2>Editors</h2><ul><li>Evaluate solely on academic merit without discrimination.</li><li>Maintain confidentiality and independence.</li><li>Address misconduct and ethical complaints.</li></ul><h2>Policies</h2><p>All manuscripts undergo double-blind review. Articles are open access under CC BY-NC 4.0. FAIR data sharing is encouraged. Suspected plagiarism is investigated, and corrections and retractions follow COPE.</p>
